If it's referents yuou want, use 'lo'.  As for whose idea it all was, it go=
es back to JCB and before him to, who was a good logician.  It helps to thi=
nk things through beforehand to get the clearest, but that doesn't help rea=
d someone else's garble.
There is in Lojban no simple quantified for "exists", which is merely anoth=
er predicate, whose extension need not encompass the universe of discourse,=
 to which"there is an x" applies.

Sent from my iPad

